#: ../../source/docs/modules/speech.rst:3 f4fbf1b12696435aa22c070351cd4ee5
msgid "Text-to-Speech"
msgstr "文字转语音"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/speech.rst:9 bb2c0dbbf2474849a5c5ff1d3d67f67b
msgid ""
"Activates the text-to-speech function. It will \"say\" any important "
"annoucements throughout the flight using the system default sound hardware."
msgstr "激活文字转语音功能，在飞行中使用系统默认声音硬件「朗读」重要公告。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/speech.rst:14 f4d7fdb43730453fbe3af6c00d5b4c33
msgid ""
"On some systems, the \"python-espeak\" or \"python3-speechd\" package may be"
" required."
msgstr "在某些系统上，可能需要安装 「python-espeak」 或 「python3-speechd」 包。"
